# Single-owner repository.
#
# A second human reviewer does not exist, so branch protection must not require one:
# the control that replaces it is a commit-scoped approval record for release
# (docs/evidence/approvals/, enforced by gate G6) plus the gate report in the PR.
#
# Keep this file in sync with the GitHub team if the project gains maintainers.

*                                   @LOOPAPPdev

# Governance and evidence are reviewed by the accountable owner, not by an agent.
/config/                            @LOOPAPPdev
/agents/                            @LOOPAPPdev
/docs/specifications/               @LOOPAPPdev
/docs/evidence/approvals/           @LOOPAPPdev
/.github/workflows/                 @LOOPAPPdev

# The catalog engine is the implementation of record (see ADR 0005).
/scripts/lego_catalog.py            @LOOPAPPdev
/catalog/                           @LOOPAPPdev
/schemas/                           @LOOPAPPdev
